        "verbatim": "Hello Jane! I've verified your identity and checked the coverage for your post-hip replacement care needs. Here's what I found:\n\n## Coverage Status\n\n**Skilled Nursing Care (42 days):**\n- \u2705 **Covered** under your Private Insurance plan\n- **Reason**: Medically necessary post-surgical recovery\n\n**Physical Therapy (42 days):**\n- \u2705 **Covered** under your Private Insurance plan  \n- **Reason**: Post-surgical rehabilitation\n\n## Pre-Authorization Requirements\n\n**Both services require pre-authorization because they exceed 21 days:**\n1. **Skilled Nursing**: Prior approval needed from your insurance carrier before scheduling\n2. **Physical Therapy**: Prior approval needed, along with documentation of medical necessity from your surgeon\n\n## Coverage Limitations\n\n**For Physical Therapy:**\n- Daily maximum: 2 therapy sessions\n- Annual cap: 6-month limit on post-surgical rehabilitation services\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. **Contact your insurance carrier** directly to initiate the pre-authorization process for both services\n2. **Obtain documentation** from your surgeon regarding medical necessity for the 42-day therapy plan\n3. **Once pre-authorization is approved**, you can schedule services with us (minimum 48-hour notice for routine scheduling)\n\n**Important Notes:**\n- The pre-authorization process itself is handled through your insurance carrier, not through our scheduling system\n- Services can only be scheduled once we receive confirmation of insurance approval\n- Emergency scheduling (2-hour notice) incurs a $35 surcharge but still requires pre-authorization\n\nWould you like me to help you schedule these services once you've obtained the necessary pre-authorizations?",
